      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "From start to finish, our experienced and qualified engineers will work closely with you to identify personal care and home appliance solutions that meet your business needs.",
